@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 09. Daily Top-up Reconciliation

|Accounting/Finance|
start
:Provide Gateway Transaction File;

|Internal Wallet System|
if (File Format Valid?) then (No)
  |Accounting/Finance|
  :Request Corrected File;
  stop
else (Yes)
  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Cross-check Transactions;

  if (Fully Matched?) then (Yes)
    :Mark Reconciliation as SUCCESS;
  else (No)
    :Generate Discrepancy List;

    |Accounting/Finance|
    :Review & Resolve Exceptions;

    |Internal Wallet System|
    :Apply Financial Adjustments;
    note right
      Includes updating transaction
      amounts, fixing statuses,
      or triggering manual refunds.
    end note
  endif
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
:Archive Final Report;
stop
@enduml